<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 227 0 R /Rect [ 56.696999 654.642001 538.617004 745.602 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure4) /TU (Forest plot showing mean differences between experimental and control groups for three studies. Individual study results with confidence intervals are plotted as green squares. Combined mean difference is 1.80 with a 95% confidence interval of 0.79 to 2.80, favoring the experimental group. Heterogeneity statistics are detailed below the plot.) /Type /Annot >>
