389 0 obj
<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 227 0 R /Rect [ 56.696999 493.379977 538.617004 592.739978 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure5) /TU (Forest plot displaying a meta-analysis of four studies comparing experimental and control groups. The standardized mean differences \(SMD\) and 95% confidence intervals \(CI\) are shown for each study, with overall SMD at -1.38 [-1.73, -1.04]. Heterogeneity is significant \(Chi≤ = 56.15, df = 3, P < 0.00001; I≤ = 95%\). The plot indicates a greater effect favoring the experimental group.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
