<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 227 0 R /Rect [ 56.696999 325.133944 538.617004 424.73395 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure6) /TU (Forest plot showing the standardized mean difference between experimental and control groups across four studies. Each study is plotted with a point estimate and confidence interval. Overall effect size is -3.50 with a confidence interval of -6.03 to -0.98, favoring the experimental group. Heterogeneity is high, with an I-squared of 97%.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
