<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Forest plot displaying a meta-analysis of four studies comparing experimental and control groups. The standardized mean differences \(SMD\) and 95% confidence intervals \(CI\) are shown for each study, with overall SMD at -1.38 [-1.73, -1.04]. Heterogeneity is significant \(Chi≤ = 56.15, df = 3, P < 0.00001; I≤ = 95%\). The plot indicates a greater effect favoring the experimental group.) /K 467 0 R /P 230 0 R /Pg 227 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
